158359,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIguvFw","user":{"login":"dmlary","id":857742,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1Nzc0Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/857742?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlary","html_url":"https://github.com/dmlary","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlary/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlary/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlary/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlary/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlary/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlary/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlary/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlary/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlary/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-02T13:19:21Z","updated_at":"2026-07-02T13:19:36Z","body":"I am absolutely losing my mind.  I had this hit this weekend on 4.7, but now even I'm not able to reproduce as far back as 4.5.\n\nI'll keep digging into this until I can reproduce reliably.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4866158359/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4866714092","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118228#issuecomment-4866714092","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118228","id":4866714092,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIhQp7A","user":{"login":"dmlary","id":857742,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1Nzc0Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/857742?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlary","html_url":"https://github.com/dmlary","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlary/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlary/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlary/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlary/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlary/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlary/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlary/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlary/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlary/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-02T14:14:57Z","updated_at":"2026-07-02T14:14:57Z","body":"Ah ha!  I'm not crazy!  Here's the trick, it must be a syntax error in the .gd file so that it's a `res://` link.  Number two, that file must have previously loaded successfully.\n\nIn this video:\n- set external editor to /bin/echo, to print file/line info\n- attached debugger and added one breakpoint at `ScriptEditorPlugin::open_in_external_editor`\n- edit previously good script to introduce a syntax error\n- switch over to godot to generate error message\n- click on error message\n- first ScriptEditorPlugin::open_in_external_editor() hits with line properly set\n- second ScriptEditorPlugin::open_in_external_editor() hits with line == -1\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dac964bc-8b9e-47b6-8994-9c797ead503a","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4866714092/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5229330590","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118228#issueco